    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eren Lai dreamed of becoming a game developer. Now though, he is just an Associate Accountant at Formworks LLC. It wasn't always like this, though; Eren once led a promising project as a game design student, but the game never came out. What went so terribly wrong?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Changelog, you'll play increasingly-developed builds of the game Eren made with his friends. You'll read through their chat logs and development diaries to discover secrets about the levels. And you'll unravel the story of how it all came crashing down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A searchable keyword system that connects secrets in the builds with hints in the game development wiki</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over the course of a 2-3 hour playthrough, players will experience the story of Eren's group and decide for themselves who was to blame</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An entire game-within-a-game (that's like two games for the price of none!) </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eren Lai dreamed of becoming a game developer. Now though, he is just an Associate Accountant at Formworks LLC. It wasn't always like this, though; Eren once led a promising project as a game design student, but the game never came out. What went so terribly wrong?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Changelog, you'll play increasingly-developed builds of the game Eren made with his friends. You'll read through their chat logs and development diaries to discover secrets about the levels. And you'll unravel the story of how it all came crashing down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A searchable keyword system that connects secrets in the builds with hints in the game development wiki</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over the course of a 2-3 hour playthrough, players will experience the story of Eren's group and decide for themselves who was to blame</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An entire game-within-a-game (that's like two games for the price of none!) </p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "In 2016, a group of ambitious students got together to make the best adventure game ever \u2014 but they failed. Discover their story by playing through different builds of their game and reading their development logs.",
